<description>&lt;p&gt;An ambush in eastern DR Congo targeted forces linked to Erik Prince's security firm, killing an ex-New Zealand special forces officer and wounding former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy and a retired US Green Beret. The attack reflects the growing presence of private mercenary groups in the conflict that has intensified around the M23 rebel campaign. An AU panel is meeting President Tshisekedi in Kinshasa as part of shuttle diplomacy on the crisis. The UCDP recorded 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPQTI2RlpMX051UHBQd0tyT0R2LXlDUFRjTUxfRnZqNWhTMWN3ZVdXUGZqSnVkUEV0am9SVXJkRHoyVEx0ajQtUTBhNV9ER2JLUGZLemZSRU5tVVRPX1NmNEdtZGtQcmZfWUFPWmVlVExLeWtnYzNGQlVRamwyc0pzMXV1blVzd09hRG51eklyR0FxVjhrNEdJRmlKUVlMLWtSU1hSQ1daMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPSnRfZTRYeTRDaDlhaTVnODk3Z2xDU2wtSlUzQ0luYmNfZGlTNGRNOVBvVURsTklDYjFSUFRvT2ZEYjd3RUxLSmZQUUlNcGRCS1VYLS1NdUJ6Q0ZoU2RqemlXNWROWHNnYkFBVEc2bmp0T201UnJmaEhhMmhlRTk1c2d5eDBXc2tkcWgweWRmbW8wMThWcHIzUkhpbVZWRjhQRW1JMW1wNU5EeVVJWVhWR3gxblRqaG11UjlzajB3YjI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFByT2JONGJWNWpDSG1XdF9wWlpKeUMtV2N3VTVTZkIxeWNZTkY2OXdCNHR4Z2ppSlhWRXhLU3ZFbTgtb19fNDYwLTZBbDZFWU1SSldORmVZQzY3VllidkcweWZCTUxDcGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;SuaraGarut.ID&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Express US&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQdTNOSmpaelh5UVNSRzhIUTQwZTFWSzRGdG1oalhIYzFLenFIaUJCYkZHRzNfRXhBazV4YzZyMjIwbWR0cWdhUGdvbGN4eV8zaGNZRHBWWUJXQk5xelhGUmd4bnhCUzdTaTVVOFgxZE5QR05oZG13dE14UE44cUtDOTZSWVcyN2dnbWtfZjh3bFdOUGUxZ29wWkt3MXVaYkRzelAtQm5lQXdwQ1EySkI3Y1RCY0xRaUh2S195SWJaakk?oc=